# Copy to .github/CODEOWNERS in the game repo and replace the placeholder with Corey's
# GitHub username (keep the leading at-sign).
# ADVICE ONLY unless the repo is PUBLIC, Corey owns it, and branch protection has
# "Require review from Code Owners" and "Do not allow bypassing" turned on. On a private
# Free repo, or for the repo owner by default, nothing here is enforced.
# Last matching line wins; every line names Corey, so the explicit paths below are a list of
# what deserves the closest look, not a different rule.
*                          @corey-github-username-here

# Key, address and helper-config files (the safety workflow also fails on these)
.env*                      @corey-github-username-here
.aider*                    @corey-github-username-here
**/kaggle.json             @corey-github-username-here
**/access_token            @corey-github-username-here

# Files that change how tools behave
/.github/                  @corey-github-username-here
/.vscode/                  @corey-github-username-here
/.continue/                @corey-github-username-here
/.husky/                   @corey-github-username-here
.gitattributes             @corey-github-username-here
.npmrc                     @corey-github-username-here
package.json               @corey-github-username-here
package-lock.json          @corey-github-username-here
vite.config.*              @corey-github-username-here
